                                "sense_id": "bba64caa-fe21-36d1-812e-3efaec125a67",
                                "text": "Many efforts have been made to improve and increase the variety of our game stock, but whereas the Barbary partridge, the willow grouse, the colin, bob-white, button quail, and even tinamou have been tried and failed […]"
